{"verse_key": "14:30", "surah": 14, "verse": 30, "text_uthmani": "وَجَعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ أَندَادًا لِّيُضِلُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِهِۦ ۗ قُلْ تَمَتَّعُوا۟ فَإِنَّ مَصِيرَكُمْ إِلَى ٱلنَّارِ", "translation": "And they have attributed to Allāh equals to mislead [people] from His way. Say, \"Enjoy yourselves, for indeed, your destination is the Fire.\"", "verse_from_ms": 656480, "verse_to_ms": 679020, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَجَعَلُوا۟", "start_ms": 656480, "end_ms": 656990}, {"i": 1, "text": "لِلَّهِ", "start_ms": 656990, "end_ms": 658190}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَندَادًا", "start_ms": 658190, "end_ms": 658990}, {"i": 3, "text": "لِّيُضِلُّوا۟", "start_ms": 658990, "end_ms": 660110}, {"i": 4, "text": "عَن", "start_ms": 660110, "end_ms": 660920}, {"i": 5, "text": "سَبِيلِهِۦ", "start_ms": 660920, "end_ms": 662810}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 662810, "end_ms": 663740}, {"i": 7, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 663740, "end_ms": 664800}, {"i": 8, "text": "تَمَتَّعُوا۟", "start_ms": 664800, "end_ms": 665980}, {"i": 9, "text": "فَإِنَّ", "start_ms": 665980, "end_ms": 667300}, {"i": 10, "text": "مَصِيرَكُمْ", "start_ms": 667300, "end_ms": 668230}, {"i": 11, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 668230, "end_ms": 669280}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلنَّارِ", "start_ms": 669280, "end_ms": 672530}]}